# docs/for/developers.md: where the shield sits in an application.
title The shield runs first in the front controller; the application reads its decision and can ask for more
row  fc:box "Front controller" "protectFile() first" | decision:warnbox "The decision" "Shield::current()" | app:okbox "Your application" "reads cacheable()"
row  plugin:box "A plugin" "decided(), ended()" | ask:box "Ask for more" "consume(), requirePass(), widget()"
arrow fc -> decision
arrow decision -> app "passes" go
arrow app -> ask "when it needs to"
arrow decision -> plugin "every request"
note The rules stay in the rule file; the code only asks.
